rds and chip away at my hand.\n\nReason:  \nPlaying a low pair like ♥5 ♣5 minimizes risk, uses up two small cards, and avoids triggering unnecessary bombs or high-card plays from the peasants. It maintains pressure on them to respond without giving away control prematurely. Since I\'m the landlord and need to finish fast, efficient card disposal matters more than dominance here.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥5", "♣5"]}'}
